  "description": "Ultra-comfortable with dual front and rear suspension, an ergonomic saddle, and wide tires, it’s always ready for an urban adventure. It glides effortlessly over cobblestones, offering an exceptionally smooth ride. Its Enviolo transmission, available in manual or automatic versions, ensures fluid, seamless pedaling with no jolts. In the Automatiq version, it takes care of gear changes for you—continuously, quietly, and without effort—for a simple, natural riding experience completely free from constraints. Silent and maintenance-free thanks to its belt drive, the Mardi 27.6 FS lets you ride with a free mind and absolute comfort on every journey.",
